      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CANYA ALL UP (1) has been below best and missed the frame last couple, finishing 6th (20.21) last time in a Other at this track. Form here at this distance is strong including three wins. Was a winner at his only start from this draw. Has ability and can bounce back. AARIELLA'S GIRL (3) ran below best last time finishing sixth (20.01) over 340m at this track in a Grade 5. Form here at the trip sound including four wins. Has won five of nine starts from this draw. One of the main contenders. JORJI'S JAZZ (2) chased the lead early from the inside and boxed on well to finish third, beaten 2.75 lengths (30.37) at Launceston in a Grade 5 over 515m. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Expected to be in the finish again. DON'T SLIP MICK (5) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
